## Goal

Create one shared timeline system for both uploaded audio projects and YouTube projects so behavior and visuals are consistent across the app.

## Core Direction

Replace the split model:

- Uploaded audio = WaveSurfer waveform/timeline
- YouTube = synthetic visualizer/timeline

With one long-term model:

- Uploaded audio = unified timeline shell + real waveform peaks
- YouTube = unified synthetic timeline shell + generated/synthetic peaks

The timeline should own:

- Click-to-seek
- Drag selection
- Shift+drag Focus Loop creation
- Region rendering
- Playhead rendering
- Zoom
- Pan/scroll
- Practice/Edit mode behavior
- Mobile timeline behavior

Audio playback engines may remain source-specific.

## Non-Goals

Do not remove existing WaveSurfer implementation immediately.
Do not break saved project data.
Do not change Practice Section / Focus Loop terminology.
Do not change cloud schema unless absolutely necessary.
Do not change YouTube playback integration unless required.

